---
import DocLayout from '../../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import { t, getDocPath } from '../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = 'en';
const tr = t(lang);
---

<DocLayout title={tr.docs.sections.vision} lang={lang} section="vision" editPath="src/pages/en/docs/vision.astro">
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">{tr.docs.sections.vision}</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 max-w-3xl">{tr.docs.descriptions.vision}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mission Statement -->
    <section>
      <h2 id="mission" class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-4">
        <a href="#mission" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors underline decoration-zinc-300 dark:decoration-zinc-600">#</a> Mission Statement
      </h2>
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4 py-2 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 italic text-lg">
        "COM exists to make every living thing identifiable by anyone, anywhere — even without cell signal, even without formal training, even in the languages that field guides forgot."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 mt-4">
        COM is a bridge between the naturalist's eye and the conservationist's database, built in the open so the data it generates belongs to the commons.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- The Problem -->
    <section>
      <h2 id="problem" class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-4">
        <a href="#problem" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors underline decoration-zinc-300 dark:decoration-zinc-600">#</a> The Problem
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Tool fragmentation</p>
          <p>PlantNet handles plants, Merlin handles birds, iNaturalist handles community curation — but no single platform unifies photo, audio, video, and ecological evidence into one workflow. Field workers juggle 3-4 apps per outing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-1">Training data bias</p>
          <p>Most AI models are trained on North American and European specimens. Megadiverse Neotropical regions are critically underrepresented, leading to poor accuracy where it matters most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Our Approach -->
    <section>
      <h2 id="approach" class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-4">
        <a href="#approach" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-emerald-500 transition-colors underline decoration-zinc-300 dark:decoration-zinc-600">#</a> Our Approach
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Multi-modal ID</span> — One UI for photo, audio, video, and ecological evidence</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">AI ensemble</span> — Gemini Flash for best-in-class accuracy across taxa</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Offline-first</span> — Full functionality via cached ONNX models and IndexedDB, sync when signal returns</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Expert curation</span> — Community validation with taxonomic badges, dispute resolution, and research-grade consensus</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0"></span>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Conservation pipeline</span> — We share biodiversity data with scientific and conservation platforms in Argentina and worldwide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</DocLayout>
